      "visit_number": 4,
      "text": "The Hand entered by the crown gantry before Heartstrike was complete. Orren mapped the three strokes, Maela posted a foundry watch, Siva found gas behind the southern wall, and Hadrik cut the visible relay. With no safe overflow or pressure sequence, they withdrew."
    },
