      "sequence": 76,
      "operation_number": 29,
      "type": "visit_note_recorded",
      "visit_number": 8,
      "text": "Hadrik called a roof truce before either side could see uniforms through the dust. The Hand and Mael Rusk cleared the fall, compared Venn's order with Bas's countermand, and sent a false completion pulse while Brann moved his reserve."
    },
